WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:35.070
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.110 --> 01:36.860
[Episode 2]

01:57.550 --> 01:58.390
What's wrong?

01:58.390 --> 02:00.790
You're so quiet this morning, looking troubled.

02:01.390 --> 02:03.610
It's about the new ship.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.290
He believes we can make a profit.

02:05.660 --> 02:07.030
What if we can't?

02:07.590 --> 02:09.949
But it's been profitable, hasn't it?

02:10.229 --> 02:11.070
On this canal,

02:11.070 --> 02:12.580
Boss Xie is an expert.

02:12.610 --> 02:13.830
He can't be wrong.

02:13.830 --> 02:14.830
Don't think too much.

02:15.440 --> 02:16.800
Have you done the math?

02:16.850 --> 02:20.570
[Breakfast]

02:17.100 --> 02:18.440
Yes.

02:18.710 --> 02:20.700
It's profitable if we can get many clients.

02:21.470 --> 02:23.750
But it's just a small business.

02:24.160 --> 02:25.840
I don't dare take risks.

02:25.890 --> 02:26.810
Besides,

02:26.829 --> 02:29.310
it's just Xie and Lao'er now.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.110
They can handle

02:31.150 --> 02:32.070
a 500-ton ship.

02:32.070 --> 02:33.220
But if they trade up,

02:33.270 --> 02:34.200
I'm afraid

02:34.470 --> 02:35.630
they'll have to hire another person.

02:35.680 --> 02:37.590
The cost

02:37.590 --> 02:39.230
will definitely increase a lot.

02:39.230 --> 02:40.440
Yeah.

02:40.590 --> 02:41.430
How much will that cost?

02:41.430 --> 02:42.390
Coming.

02:42.560 --> 02:43.579
I gotta go.

02:44.100 --> 02:45.510
Coming. Coming.

02:48.150 --> 02:49.310
Stir before eating.

02:53.340 --> 02:55.020
Xie Wanghe, why are you so late?

02:55.140 --> 02:57.070
I forgot to set an alarm last night.

02:57.070 --> 02:57.710
You…

02:58.510 --> 02:59.590
This isn't over!

02:59.590 --> 03:01.630
I'll teach you a lesson after school!

03:01.670 --> 03:03.670
Watch your step!

03:07.950 --> 03:09.870
Wait, wait, wait!

03:09.870 --> 03:10.430
You brat.

03:10.430 --> 03:11.420
You're late!

03:18.170 --> 03:19.550
Class, take out your textbook

03:19.590 --> 03:21.150
and turn to page 54.

03:21.270 --> 03:22.060
May I come in?

03:22.230 --> 03:23.660
Why are you late again?

03:23.760 --> 03:24.920
You don't pay attention in class

03:24.950 --> 03:26.430
and are always late to school.

03:26.910 --> 03:28.990
If this goes on, I'll call your father.

03:29.020 --> 03:30.270
I won't be late again.

03:30.290 --> 03:31.090
Come in.

03:32.030 --> 03:33.660
Come on. Let's continue.

03:37.870 --> 03:38.860
Fenghua!

03:39.620 --> 03:40.530
Madam,

03:40.560 --> 03:41.670
Xie Wanghe is threatening me!

03:41.670 --> 03:43.150
No. She tripped me first!

03:43.070 --> 03:44.900
[Mountain Trip]

03:43.150 --> 03:43.790
We're in class!

03:43.790 --> 03:45.110
Be quiet! Sit down.

03:46.220 --> 03:48.150
Today, we're going to learn a poem called

03:48.150 --> 03:49.230
"Mountain Trip."

03:49.230 --> 03:50.550
Can anyone tell me

03:50.590 --> 03:52.790
what season this poem is about?

03:53.310 --> 03:54.190
Okay, Chen Rui.

03:54.710 --> 03:55.790
Autumn.

03:55.790 --> 03:56.710
Great. Autumn.

03:56.750 --> 03:57.350
Sit down.

03:57.880 --> 04:00.360
Let's read this poem together, shall we?

04:00.650 --> 04:03.710
"Walking up the rocky path in the cold mountain."

04:03.780 --> 04:08.300
"Walking up the rocky path in the cold mountain."

04:08.330 --> 04:11.160
"Amid rising white clouds, a village was seen."

04:11.200 --> 04:15.510
"Amid rising white clouds, a village was seen."

04:15.630 --> 04:18.839
"I stopped the coach, drawn by the maple woods at dusk."

04:18.860 --> 04:23.290
-"I stopped the coach, drawn by the maple woods at dusk."
-Director.

04:23.870 --> 04:26.730
[Mountain Trip]

04:25.070 --> 04:26.830
She just transferred

04:26.830 --> 04:28.430
from another school.

04:29.710 --> 04:30.990
She lives in our neighborhood.

04:31.030 --> 04:31.930
She's so pretty.

04:32.020 --> 04:33.700
Is she going to study with us?

04:35.950 --> 04:37.310
What's your name?

04:37.350 --> 04:38.230
Ma Siyi.

04:38.550 --> 04:40.180
What? Louder!

04:40.230 --> 04:41.070
I can't hear you.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.070
She said Ma Siyi!

04:42.070 --> 04:42.950
Are you deaf?

04:42.950 --> 04:43.970
I'll get you for this.

04:44.110 --> 04:46.030
There's an empty seat over there.

04:46.070 --> 04:46.830
Go.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.909
Siyi, sit here.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.770
Siyi.

04:51.870 --> 04:54.180
Okay. Let's finish reading this poem.

04:54.270 --> 04:57.510
"Frosty leaves were redder than flowers in February."

04:57.570 --> 05:01.140
"Frosty leaves were redder than flowers in February."

05:01.160 --> 05:01.750
Siyi.

05:01.790 --> 05:04.030
"Frosty leaves were redder than flowers in February." Great.

05:04.070 --> 05:05.560
Frosty leaves are…

05:05.580 --> 05:06.580
Siyi.

05:06.610 --> 05:09.310
What kind of leaves are they?

05:09.420 --> 05:12.670
Maple leaves. Yes. Maple leaves.

05:12.700 --> 05:14.410
What color are maple leaves?

05:14.490 --> 05:15.070
Red.

05:15.070 --> 05:15.990
Madam,

05:15.990 --> 05:17.670
Xie Wanghe is disrupting the class order!

05:17.670 --> 05:19.070
What do you want, Xia Fenghua?

05:19.070 --> 05:20.390
Xie Wanghe!

05:20.410 --> 05:21.520
Xie Wanghe!

05:22.220 --> 05:23.070
Get out!

05:23.070 --> 05:25.390
Xia Fenghua pushed me first.

05:25.390 --> 05:26.350
Get out!

05:30.790 --> 05:32.070
Xia Fenghua!

05:32.070 --> 05:33.150
You go out too!

05:33.190 --> 05:34.440
Stand on either side of the corridor.

05:37.840 --> 05:39.340
Come on, let's continue.

05:39.590 --> 05:41.380
They're redder

05:41.380 --> 05:43.600
than flowers in February.

05:43.750 --> 05:47.030
The first line: "Walking up the rocky path in the cold mountain."

05:47.500 --> 05:50.790
Going into the mountain in late autumn.

05:50.830 --> 05:52.330
The mountain road…

05:52.550 --> 06:02.140
[Flower Street Dock]

05:52.600 --> 05:53.320
Granny.

05:54.550 --> 05:56.070
Siyi will stay?

05:58.390 --> 06:00.590
I got her into the local school.

06:00.630 --> 06:02.390
She'll stay here.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.480
What is her mother thinking?

06:04.520 --> 06:05.840
Is she really her mother?

06:05.870 --> 06:06.740
If someone

06:06.760 --> 06:08.480
tried to steal Fenghua,

06:08.510 --> 06:09.800
I'd stop them at all costs!

06:10.100 --> 06:10.950
Well,

06:10.950 --> 06:12.550
she remarried

06:12.550 --> 06:13.670
and had another child.

06:13.670 --> 06:16.390
She can't raise two kids at the same time.

06:16.410 --> 06:17.620
It's not easy for her.

06:17.640 --> 06:18.960
Then she shouldn't have had another kid.

06:18.990 --> 06:19.990
How could a mother

06:20.020 --> 06:21.240
abandon her own child?

06:21.350 --> 06:22.860
Don't be so harsh.

06:22.900 --> 06:24.570
She had the right to remarry.

06:24.620 --> 06:25.280
Yes.

06:25.320 --> 06:26.030
Yuling.

06:26.190 --> 06:28.300
What would you do if you were her?

06:29.210 --> 06:30.710
Isn't it obvious?

06:30.740 --> 06:32.300
Children are the most important.

06:32.320 --> 06:33.480
If I remarry,

06:33.510 --> 06:34.300
I must get

06:34.330 --> 06:35.530
Fenghua's permission first,

06:35.550 --> 06:36.120
right?

06:36.140 --> 06:38.390
Mom, who's remarrying?

06:38.430 --> 06:39.230
What did Dad do?

06:39.230 --> 06:41.070
My god.

06:41.110 --> 06:41.670
The adults are talking.

06:41.670 --> 06:42.590
Don't interrupt!

06:42.630 --> 06:43.390
Go away!

06:43.390 --> 06:44.550
Go home and do your homework.

06:46.430 --> 06:49.380
How was your first day at school?

06:49.380 --> 06:50.550
Not bad.

06:52.110 --> 06:53.550
Good.

06:54.460 --> 06:55.540
Are you hungry?

06:55.950 --> 06:56.630
Let me get you a…

06:56.659 --> 06:57.409
Well…

06:57.450 --> 06:58.480
I have sesame balls here.

06:57.500 --> 06:59.080
[By the Canal]

06:58.490 --> 06:59.500
Siyi, here.

07:00.220 --> 07:01.500
Have a sesame ball.

07:01.520 --> 07:02.470
Try it.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.980
Is it good?

07:08.390 --> 07:09.650
It's delicious, right?

07:19.300 --> 07:19.910
Here.

07:21.060 --> 07:23.240
Mom, the braised pork you made is amazing.

07:23.790 --> 07:25.040
Don't just eat meat.

07:25.070 --> 07:25.870
Eating too much meat

07:25.870 --> 07:26.760
will make you fat.

07:26.870 --> 07:28.700
Then Wanghe won't marry you after he grows up.

07:28.730 --> 07:30.160
He wouldn't dare.

07:30.180 --> 07:31.310
Why not?

07:31.620 --> 07:32.550
I just know it.

07:34.520 --> 07:35.470
Don't burn yourself.

07:37.159 --> 07:37.930
Delicious.

07:38.260 --> 07:39.150
Go eat inside.

07:41.850 --> 07:42.909
Wanghe.

07:43.570 --> 07:45.740
Come. Bring the dishes over.

07:45.770 --> 07:46.659
Coming.

07:49.190 --> 07:50.180
Okay.

08:00.750 --> 08:01.550
Siyi.

08:01.580 --> 08:03.690
Here, have another bun.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.450
Here.

08:04.660 --> 08:05.860
I'm full.

08:09.390 --> 08:09.950
Siyi.

08:09.950 --> 08:11.550
Are you feeling unwell?

08:11.550 --> 08:12.680
Tell me.

08:13.230 --> 08:14.030
No.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.310
Then have another bun.

08:17.310 --> 08:19.110
You're growing.

08:19.110 --> 08:21.950
Grandma, I really can't eat anymore.

08:22.750 --> 08:24.270
Enjoy your dinner.

08:24.550 --> 08:27.330
I'll wash the dishes after I finish my homework.

09:37.360 --> 09:38.950
Are you almost done?

09:38.950 --> 09:39.990
One pot left.

09:39.990 --> 09:41.420
Almost done?

09:42.930 --> 09:44.860
It's really not easy work.

09:44.860 --> 09:47.500
You get up two hours earlier than us every day.

09:47.500 --> 09:48.690
Yeah.

09:50.310 --> 09:51.900
Why don't you do something else?

09:53.740 --> 09:55.480
What else can I do?

09:55.990 --> 09:58.060
When will they come back today?

09:58.230 --> 09:59.360
No idea.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.630
Those men

10:00.630 --> 10:02.190
forget their homes when they're at sea.

10:02.190 --> 10:03.190
They wish they could never come back.

10:03.190 --> 10:03.670
Morning.

10:03.670 --> 10:04.830
Granny Ma, let me help you.

10:04.870 --> 10:05.540
No need.

10:05.540 --> 10:06.310
No need.

10:07.110 --> 10:08.710
Go on with your work.

10:09.070 --> 10:10.500
Did you use the herbal plaster I gave you yesterday?

10:10.500 --> 10:11.670
Yes.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.670
Granny Ma.

10:12.670 --> 10:14.750
Morning.

10:14.840 --> 10:16.250
Everything's set?

10:16.570 --> 10:17.700
Be careful.

10:18.310 --> 10:18.860
Okay.

10:18.860 --> 10:19.870
Careful.

10:21.330 --> 10:22.270
Let me help you.

10:22.270 --> 10:23.670
I'm good.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.600
Let me help you.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.390
I got it.

10:25.660 --> 10:27.030
Yan, pick that up for me.

10:27.030 --> 10:27.510
Okay.

10:27.510 --> 10:28.190
Be careful.

10:28.230 --> 10:29.390
Take it down.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.760
Thank you. Please come again.

10:43.830 --> 10:44.840
Fresh-made mung bean cakes!

10:44.840 --> 10:46.170
Come take a look!

10:46.230 --> 10:46.990
Wanghe.

10:46.280 --> 10:51.680
[Flower Street Dock]

10:47.270 --> 10:49.260
Your dad is a real man.

10:50.350 --> 10:51.350
What do you mean?

10:52.230 --> 10:53.730
Come on. Eat your fill.

10:53.730 --> 10:55.710
Last night, when I was sleeping,

10:56.050 --> 10:58.230
I heard your dad snoring.

10:58.990 --> 11:01.480
He snored even louder than Li Yuanba.

11:01.590 --> 11:02.510
Hurry up.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.750
Finish it and go to school.

11:03.750 --> 11:04.550
If you're late again,

11:04.590 --> 11:05.990
you're cooked.

11:05.990 --> 11:07.510
Mom, it's Saturday.

11:10.020 --> 11:11.250
Still, eat quickly.

11:11.360 --> 11:12.500
Then go do your thing.

11:12.500 --> 11:13.810
Don't sit at the table for long.

11:14.110 --> 11:14.750
Mom.

11:16.370 --> 11:17.660
Give me five yuan.

11:18.860 --> 11:20.010
Take it yourself.

11:20.160 --> 11:20.960
Here.

11:23.370 --> 11:24.500
Only five yuan.

11:25.090 --> 11:26.030
Thank you, Mom.

11:26.220 --> 11:27.710
Guys, let's go.

11:29.870 --> 11:30.960
Your breakfast!

11:31.140 --> 11:32.570
You haven't finished it yet!

11:33.710 --> 11:35.910
Those kids ran off as soon as they were full.

11:36.370 --> 11:37.500
He took the money and ran off.

11:38.840 --> 11:40.250
I want one!

11:40.930 --> 11:42.030
I want one!

11:42.690 --> 11:43.190
I want one!

11:43.190 --> 11:44.350
Why are you following us?

11:45.500 --> 11:46.810
Aren't you afraid of having a toothache

11:46.840 --> 11:47.870
after eating it all by yourself?

11:47.910 --> 11:49.770
Even if I lose all my teeth, it's none of your business.

11:53.850 --> 11:55.520
Stop following me.

12:00.670 --> 12:01.830
You want a bite?

12:04.750 --> 12:06.510
Five yuan per bite. You can pay in installments.

12:07.190 --> 12:08.650
Are you looking for a beating again?

12:29.820 --> 12:30.580
Hello?

12:30.980 --> 12:31.740
Mom.

12:32.300 --> 12:33.780
I dreamed of you last night.

12:34.430 --> 12:35.770
Grandma said…

12:36.390 --> 12:37.630
Grandma said…

12:40.540 --> 12:41.470
Siyi,

12:41.500 --> 12:43.090
just tell me what it is.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.560
Why are you crying?

12:44.670 --> 12:45.950
You're a big girl now.

12:46.470 --> 12:49.150
Mom, how long do I have to stay at Grandma's?

12:49.150 --> 12:50.890
When will you take me back?

12:51.100 --> 12:53.270
I can look after my brother for you.

12:53.300 --> 12:55.010
It won't affect my schoolwork.

12:55.150 --> 12:56.910
I can also do the laundry and cook.

12:55.420 --> 12:58.720
♫Far away, so far away♫

12:56.910 --> 12:58.630
I can do most of the housework.

12:59.540 --> 13:03.070
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

12:59.990 --> 13:01.820
Can't you be more considerate?

13:02.860 --> 13:04.310
Your grandma is getting on in years

13:04.140 --> 13:06.750
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

13:04.310 --> 13:05.800
and needs someone to take care of her.

13:06.290 --> 13:07.100
Besides,

13:07.250 --> 13:09.480
I've got enough on my plate.

13:07.350 --> 13:12.020
♫Listening to the river flow♫

13:09.520 --> 13:11.480
You'll live with your grandma

13:11.620 --> 13:13.060
from now on.

13:13.490 --> 13:16.150
Mom, you don't want me anymore?

13:17.420 --> 13:18.550
I told you

13:18.550 --> 13:20.100
it's just temporary.

13:18.670 --> 13:21.480
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

13:20.180 --> 13:21.310
Okay, alright.

13:21.310 --> 13:22.650
Your brother is awake. I have to go.

13:22.450 --> 13:25.980
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

13:22.670 --> 13:23.260
Bye.

13:27.240 --> 13:29.550
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

13:30.410 --> 13:34.530
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

13:37.000 --> 13:41.460
♫The sunsets in the city♫

13:42.170 --> 13:46.500
♫Hold no poetry, no distant dreams♫

13:46.910 --> 13:47.830
Ma Siyi.

13:47.850 --> 13:48.670
Ma Siyi.

13:48.670 --> 13:49.510
Siyi.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.270
What?

13:52.500 --> 13:53.990
Do you know her?

13:54.010 --> 13:54.890
My neighbor.

13:55.220 --> 13:56.100
What do you want?

13:56.130 --> 13:57.270
Introduce us.

13:58.530 --> 13:59.740
What do you mean?

13:59.760 --> 14:01.290
I want to be her friend.

14:01.570 --> 14:02.410
You?

14:02.430 --> 14:03.720
I'll buy you ice cream.

14:03.740 --> 14:04.670
Any flavor you like.

14:05.450 --> 14:06.680
I'll pass.

14:06.750 --> 14:08.030
Don't come near her again!

14:08.030 --> 14:09.270
She's your neighbor,

14:09.290 --> 14:10.530
not your wife.

14:10.550 --> 14:11.440
Mind your own business.

14:11.470 --> 14:12.300
What did you say?

14:12.610 --> 14:14.720
I said she's your neighbor, not your wife!

14:14.790 --> 14:16.470
I dare you to say that again!

14:16.490 --> 14:17.890
What are you two doing?

14:25.390 --> 14:27.240
Now, let's solve the first equation.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.590
We can see that

14:29.900 --> 14:31.420
it's division, right?

14:31.440 --> 14:32.240
First,

14:32.280 --> 14:36.300
we divide 34 by 4.

14:37.710 --> 14:39.990
Next, we write down the formula.

14:38.590 --> 14:41.750
♫Far away, so far away♫

14:41.550 --> 14:44.710
What is 34 divided by 4?

14:42.950 --> 14:46.290
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

14:44.830 --> 14:45.620
8 remainder 2.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.150
8.

14:46.150 --> 14:47.390
At most,

14:47.190 --> 14:49.840
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

14:47.390 --> 14:48.110
8,

14:48.150 --> 14:48.550
right?

14:48.550 --> 14:49.910
4 plus 8 is

14:49.910 --> 14:50.430
32.

14:50.430 --> 14:52.190
32.

14:50.500 --> 14:55.200
♫Listening to the river flow♫

14:52.190 --> 14:52.700
Remainder…

14:53.910 --> 14:54.870
Finish your dinner first!

14:54.870 --> 14:56.030
I've finished.

14:56.780 --> 14:57.730
Haikuo.

14:59.180 --> 15:00.110
Come.

15:00.500 --> 15:01.650
Where is Xingchi?

15:01.680 --> 15:02.500
I don't know.

15:02.500 --> 15:03.480
Xingchi.

15:04.420 --> 15:05.200
Come.

15:07.950 --> 15:09.240
What's wrong, Wanghe?

15:09.260 --> 15:10.460
We have a mission?

15:10.490 --> 15:11.850
What's it?

15:12.700 --> 15:14.300
You want me to do your homework again?

15:14.320 --> 15:15.170
No.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.210
Come here.

15:17.710 --> 15:19.470
It's something more important.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.130
What's it?

15:21.160 --> 15:21.830
What's it?

15:24.470 --> 15:25.440
Well…

16:06.790 --> 16:08.350
I don't know what to say.

16:08.370 --> 16:10.630
It was just a joke, wasn't it?

16:10.640 --> 16:12.170
He's serious.

16:13.630 --> 16:15.140
Don't you know

16:15.170 --> 16:16.250
that idiot

16:16.280 --> 16:18.720
would take jokes seriously?

16:19.330 --> 16:20.830
What did you say?

16:21.090 --> 16:23.410
Go explain it as soon as possible.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.150
Come out.

16:32.230 --> 16:33.110
What?

16:33.130 --> 16:34.210
Just come out.

16:34.310 --> 16:35.670
Don't ask.

17:04.560 --> 17:05.740
And then like this.

17:17.849 --> 17:19.210
Okay. Try it.

17:25.470 --> 17:26.440
How is it?

17:27.390 --> 17:28.210
Not bad.

17:29.410 --> 17:30.830
If you see it on the street,

17:30.870 --> 17:31.870
will you buy it?

17:32.190 --> 17:33.380
No, I think not.

17:33.750 --> 17:34.430
Why not?

17:35.050 --> 17:36.950
I don't like sweet things.

17:37.660 --> 17:38.840
Then what do you like to eat?

17:39.820 --> 17:40.980
Eel noodles

17:41.000 --> 17:42.230
made by my mom.

17:42.970 --> 17:44.050
My mom can make them too.

17:44.070 --> 17:46.060
I'll invite you over when she makes eel noodles.

17:49.390 --> 17:51.110
What is your strongest subject in school?

17:52.400 --> 17:53.320
Literature.

17:53.550 --> 17:54.700
How about writing?

17:55.000 --> 17:56.070
Not bad.

17:56.630 --> 17:58.380
Then you'll help me write essays,

17:58.410 --> 17:59.570
and I'll beat boys for you.

17:59.590 --> 18:00.670
Beat boys?

18:00.790 --> 18:02.660
If anyone messes with you, I'll beat him up!

18:02.680 --> 18:04.910
We'll go to school and go home together.

18:04.910 --> 18:06.730
Then we'll do homework together.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.170
It's decided then?

18:15.520 --> 18:16.610
So hot.

18:19.090 --> 18:20.500
Hot, hot!

18:33.910 --> 18:34.970
Mom.

18:35.430 --> 18:36.030
What?

18:36.030 --> 18:37.190
My dear mom,

18:37.190 --> 18:39.070
can you give me some money?

18:39.270 --> 18:41.620
I gave you money just last week.

18:41.880 --> 18:43.400
I spent it all.

18:45.100 --> 18:45.980
Mom.

18:46.810 --> 18:47.790
How much do you want?

18:48.570 --> 18:49.650
How much do you have?

18:50.880 --> 18:52.610
You want every penny I have?

19:04.840 --> 19:06.050
So little?

19:06.240 --> 19:07.430
Do you want it or not?

19:07.430 --> 19:08.580
Yes, yes.

19:11.100 --> 19:12.300
What are you looking at?

19:12.310 --> 19:13.760
How would I give you fake money?

19:13.790 --> 19:15.190
I'm afraid you were careless

19:15.210 --> 19:16.530
and received fake money.

19:16.630 --> 19:17.310
You brat!

19:17.310 --> 19:18.110
The basin!

19:20.760 --> 19:21.630
Thank you, Mom.

19:21.670 --> 19:23.300
I can tell fake money.

19:45.150 --> 19:46.330
I have 12 yuan and 6 jiao.

19:46.340 --> 19:47.650
32 yuan and 5 jiao.

19:47.860 --> 19:49.040
How much more do we need?

19:49.250 --> 19:50.480
80 yuan.

19:51.630 --> 19:52.950
What should we do?

19:59.730 --> 20:00.190
Let's go.

20:00.240 --> 20:00.710
What?

20:00.710 --> 20:01.510
What?

20:02.180 --> 20:03.060
Let's go make money!

20:14.660 --> 20:15.590
A new one.

20:25.330 --> 20:26.430
Got it!

20:27.930 --> 20:30.080
You're productive today.

20:31.110 --> 20:31.840
Let's go.

20:32.180 --> 20:33.310
Let's go.

20:43.040 --> 20:44.270
Be careful.

20:44.330 --> 20:45.240
Make way.

20:45.240 --> 20:46.030
Make way.

20:46.030 --> 20:47.470
Make way!

20:47.470 --> 20:48.140
Make way!

20:48.170 --> 20:49.750
Make way!

20:54.260 --> 20:55.120
Dad!

20:59.270 --> 21:01.590
You went swimming?

21:01.750 --> 21:02.670
Come out.

21:04.270 --> 21:05.220
You guys collected them?

21:06.750 --> 21:08.030
They're quite big.

21:08.050 --> 21:08.820
They're for sale.

21:10.350 --> 21:11.190
What do you mean?

21:11.490 --> 21:12.620
You want to sell them to me?

21:15.210 --> 21:15.880
Okay.

21:15.950 --> 21:16.780
How much?

21:17.100 --> 21:18.160
80 yuan.

21:18.610 --> 21:20.630
Are you trying to rob me?

21:20.670 --> 21:22.300
80 is the market price.

21:22.330 --> 21:23.120
If they're not enough,

21:23.150 --> 21:23.990
we can go back and get more.

21:23.990 --> 21:25.070
But you need to pay us first.

21:25.190 --> 21:25.860
Pay…

21:26.530 --> 21:27.380
In cash.

21:29.420 --> 21:32.270
You're really smart, aren't you?

21:32.440 --> 21:33.950
Pay in advance, right?

21:33.950 --> 21:34.640
Okay.

21:34.670 --> 21:36.110
Be careful when you're in the river.

21:36.520 --> 21:37.240
Wanghe.

21:37.280 --> 21:38.270
What are you doing here?

21:38.690 --> 21:39.450
Wait. It's…

21:39.710 --> 21:40.630
Why are you running away?

21:40.670 --> 21:42.630
Brat, put on your shoes!

21:42.630 --> 21:43.970
Don't hurt your feet.

21:45.660 --> 21:46.590
These…

21:46.800 --> 21:47.750
They collected them?

21:47.750 --> 21:48.630
Yes.

21:49.160 --> 21:49.750
Well…

21:49.750 --> 21:50.480
They sold them to me.

21:50.480 --> 21:51.830
You can't spoil them like this.

21:51.870 --> 21:52.510
It's fine.

21:52.510 --> 21:53.800
It wasn't easy.

21:53.830 --> 21:54.730
Naughty boys.

21:55.470 --> 21:56.110
Alright.

21:56.150 --> 21:56.790
Well…

21:56.790 --> 21:57.640
Hurry up.

21:57.750 --> 21:58.710
Let's eat them for dinner.

21:58.810 --> 21:59.850
For dinner.

22:00.830 --> 22:02.000
Those kids

22:02.020 --> 22:03.430
are quite business-minded.

22:03.550 --> 22:04.350
Business-minded?

22:04.390 --> 22:05.230
They can make money already.

22:05.230 --> 22:06.190
They ran away

22:06.190 --> 22:06.750
without shoes.

22:06.750 --> 22:08.200
What if they hurt their feet?

22:46.060 --> 22:48.430
Siyi, Siyi, Siyi.

22:48.430 --> 22:50.270
Do you like your new schoolbag?

22:51.190 --> 22:52.510
My new schoolbag?

22:52.550 --> 22:53.550
-Yes.
-Your new schoolbag.

22:53.570 --> 22:55.050
Look. We all have new schoolbags.

22:55.090 --> 22:55.970
We all do.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.830
If you don't like that schoolbag,

23:00.870 --> 23:02.030
we can switch with you.

23:03.890 --> 23:05.850
I like my new schoolbag.

23:06.890 --> 23:07.990
Siyi, let me fill it for you.

23:08.180 --> 23:09.240
Let me do it!

23:20.820 --> 23:21.800
Siyi, put it on.

23:22.680 --> 23:23.230
Let's go to school.

23:23.230 --> 23:24.150
Let's go.

23:24.150 --> 23:25.030
Let's go to school.

23:25.030 --> 23:26.350
Go to school!

23:47.300 --> 23:48.570
Siyi, slow down.

23:49.590 --> 23:51.200
Grandpa, I'm back!

23:51.230 --> 23:51.960
Coming.

23:52.210 --> 23:52.910
They're coming.

23:52.910 --> 23:54.710
The kids are back from school. Slow down.

23:54.730 --> 23:55.390
Go to your grandpa.

23:54.930 --> 23:58.740
[By the Canal]

23:55.390 --> 23:56.150
Come on.

23:56.240 --> 23:56.910
Sit down.

23:56.910 --> 23:57.710
Slow down.

23:58.950 --> 23:59.910
Tell the chef

23:59.910 --> 24:01.190
the food for children can't be heavy.

24:01.190 --> 24:01.500
Got it?

24:01.500 --> 24:02.870
Kids nowadays love fried food.

24:02.910 --> 24:04.160
Just do as I say.

24:04.160 --> 24:04.950
Okay.

24:05.730 --> 24:06.410
Thank you, Grandpa.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.390
Thank you, Grandpa.

24:07.390 --> 24:07.750
Okay.

24:07.830 --> 24:08.970
Eat up.

24:10.710 --> 24:11.720
Master Zhou.

24:12.470 --> 24:13.550
Master Zhou.

24:18.020 --> 24:18.950
Nice to meet you.

24:18.950 --> 24:20.150
Let me introduce someone to you.

24:20.190 --> 24:21.550
This is the new district chief,

24:21.550 --> 24:22.150
Ms. Gu.

24:22.390 --> 24:22.880
Hello.

24:22.910 --> 24:24.080
Hello, Master Zhou.

24:24.100 --> 24:25.970
He's the owner of By the Canal.

24:26.580 --> 24:27.420
Zhimei.

24:27.960 --> 24:28.560
Let me introduce you.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.330
This is my wife.

24:29.380 --> 24:30.310
This is Ms. Gu.

24:30.350 --> 24:30.870
Ms. Gu.

24:30.870 --> 24:32.110
-Nice to meet you.
-Nice to meet you.

24:32.110 --> 24:34.110
I heard many kids come to eat here.

24:34.110 --> 24:34.550
-Yes.
-Yeah. Yeah.

24:34.550 --> 24:36.510
It's convenient for them to eat together.

24:36.530 --> 24:38.350
School has started.

24:38.500 --> 24:39.920
I'm too busy with work

24:39.920 --> 24:41.470
to cook for him.

24:41.490 --> 24:44.110
So I want him to eat here.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.230
Is it okay with you?

24:45.230 --> 24:46.270
Sure, no problem.

24:46.270 --> 24:47.110
That'll be great.

24:47.150 --> 24:47.950
Chen Rui.

24:47.950 --> 24:48.830
Your classmates.

24:48.870 --> 24:49.390
Chen Rui!

24:49.390 --> 24:50.110
You know each other?

24:50.110 --> 24:50.390
Chen Rui!

24:50.390 --> 24:51.190
You all know each other.

24:51.190 --> 24:52.950
Dad, he's my classmate, Chen Rui.

24:52.950 --> 24:53.750
You're in the same class?

24:53.750 --> 24:54.110
Yeah.

24:54.150 --> 24:55.110
Come, come.

24:55.110 --> 24:55.910
Sit down.

24:55.910 --> 24:56.710
Sit here.

24:56.710 --> 24:57.380
Come, sit here.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.230
Sit here and eat.

24:58.230 --> 24:59.030
Sit.

24:59.030 --> 24:59.790
Yeah.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.550
Well,

25:00.550 --> 25:02.590
how much should I pay you every month?

25:02.630 --> 25:03.270
You don't need to pay.

25:03.270 --> 25:04.040
Take the money.

25:04.490 --> 25:05.110
If you don't,

25:05.110 --> 25:06.270
I can't let my son eat here.

25:06.270 --> 25:06.980
Ms. Gu!

25:06.980 --> 25:08.230
You're doing me a favor.

25:08.230 --> 25:09.400
Ms. Gu!

25:09.420 --> 25:10.620
Mr. Shao.

25:11.070 --> 25:13.230
Well, you're Mr. Shao, right?

25:13.230 --> 25:14.110
Yes.

25:14.140 --> 25:16.170
Ms. Gu's husband is my colleague.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.890
We work in the same office.

25:17.910 --> 25:19.050
What a coincidence.

25:19.140 --> 25:20.540
Chen Bo told me

25:20.570 --> 25:22.330
that you're writing "The Story of the Canal."

25:22.350 --> 25:23.110
Yes.

25:23.400 --> 25:25.190
Don't forget to highlight

25:25.190 --> 25:26.950
Shuipu District and Flower Street.

25:26.950 --> 25:28.560
Of course.

25:28.630 --> 25:29.740
If that's the case,

25:29.740 --> 25:31.430
I'll apply for a special

25:31.460 --> 25:33.110
cultural grant for you.

25:33.910 --> 25:34.960
Ms. Gu.

25:35.080 --> 25:36.640
No masterpiece

25:36.660 --> 25:38.420
was written for money!

25:38.460 --> 25:39.610
Mr. Shao.

25:39.640 --> 25:41.450
You're a man of noble character.

25:41.480 --> 25:42.240
I admire you.

25:42.610 --> 25:43.460
But

25:43.590 --> 25:45.620
if you take my book

25:45.650 --> 25:47.950
as a cultural project,

25:48.720 --> 25:50.770
it'll be very necessary

25:50.800 --> 25:52.480
to apply for a grant for it.

25:54.310 --> 25:56.710
If you say so…

25:57.120 --> 25:58.140
I understand.

25:58.320 --> 25:59.280
I understand.

25:59.310 --> 26:00.190
Grandpa,

26:00.210 --> 26:01.170
tell us a story.

26:01.200 --> 26:02.880
Sure. What story should I tell?

26:03.940 --> 26:04.790
The story behind this monument.

26:05.110 --> 26:06.270
This monument

26:06.300 --> 26:07.420
is quite old.

26:07.450 --> 26:08.690
I'll tell you what the inscription

26:08.750 --> 26:10.090
means later.

26:10.720 --> 26:11.750
As for who erected it,

26:11.750 --> 26:13.150
you all know his name.

26:13.500 --> 26:15.030
Do you know Prime Minister Liu Luoguo?

26:15.060 --> 26:15.790
Yes.

26:16.430 --> 26:18.180
Back then, Flower Street

26:18.220 --> 26:21.190
was very famous along the canal.

26:21.380 --> 26:23.470
Ships coming and going all had to

26:23.470 --> 26:26.030
pass through the lock here and fill out official forms.

26:26.910 --> 26:28.090
Liu Yong

26:28.120 --> 26:30.520
erected this monument to thank the people

26:30.540 --> 26:31.960
of Flower Street,

26:32.140 --> 26:34.740
wishing for the Qing dynasty's

26:34.760 --> 26:36.070
long-lasting prosperity.

26:36.330 --> 26:38.640
But didn't the Qing dynasty end long ago?

26:38.670 --> 26:39.370
Yes.

26:39.520 --> 26:42.350
Do you know how the Qing dynasty ended?

26:42.370 --> 26:43.660
The Eight-Nation Alliance.

26:44.290 --> 26:45.130
Nonsense!

26:45.270 --> 26:46.630
They only invaded Beijing.

26:46.950 --> 26:48.540
Empress Dowager Cixi fled,

26:48.660 --> 26:49.880
but the empire didn't fall.

26:51.590 --> 26:52.730
Back then,

26:52.830 --> 26:54.590
the troops of the Alliance came here.

26:55.690 --> 26:57.030
There was a foreigner

26:57.210 --> 26:58.400
from Italy

26:59.180 --> 27:01.890
whose name was something

27:02.350 --> 27:04.490
sounding like Little Polo.

27:04.510 --> 27:06.220
According to the county annals,

27:06.260 --> 27:08.480
he came to China from the South Sea

27:08.590 --> 27:11.240
and rented a big ship in Hangzhou.

27:11.390 --> 27:13.150
He hired several servants

27:13.190 --> 27:14.870
and went all the way north.

27:14.890 --> 27:15.710
Siyi.

27:16.260 --> 27:17.550
Was he your ancestor?

27:17.580 --> 27:18.900
No, Grandma said

27:18.930 --> 27:21.770
my ancestors went south from the north.

27:21.780 --> 27:22.590
That guy went north.

27:22.690 --> 27:24.360
The locals

27:24.380 --> 27:26.470
said he carried a soul absorber with him

27:26.570 --> 27:28.960
and took people's souls.

27:29.080 --> 27:30.520
Really?

27:31.000 --> 27:32.980
It was just a camera.

27:36.380 --> 27:37.470
Here, eat it.

27:37.470 --> 27:38.670
Siyi, it's really sweet.

27:38.710 --> 27:39.390
I don't want it.

27:39.390 --> 27:39.990
Take a bite.

27:39.990 --> 27:40.710
I don't want it!

27:40.710 --> 27:41.710
Just a bite.

27:41.710 --> 27:42.470
I don't eat ice cream.

27:42.470 --> 27:43.190
Try it.

27:43.230 --> 27:44.270
Don't touch me!

27:44.430 --> 27:45.660
Liang!

27:45.690 --> 27:46.590
Eat it.

27:49.030 --> 27:50.490
What are you doing?

27:50.520 --> 27:51.750
Did I hit you?

27:52.510 --> 27:53.980
Liang, stop it!

27:54.020 --> 27:54.710
Liang!

27:57.350 --> 27:58.320
Beat you up!

27:58.400 --> 27:59.230
Beat them!

27:59.230 --> 28:00.190
Stop!

28:03.870 --> 28:06.790
Stop fighting! Stop it!

28:07.730 --> 28:09.410
Let go! Break it up!

28:09.470 --> 28:10.300
What are you doing?

28:11.910 --> 28:12.480
Break it up!

28:12.480 --> 28:13.630
Get up. Let go!

28:13.650 --> 28:14.030
Let go!

28:14.060 --> 28:14.760
Let go!

28:47.820 --> 28:49.850
Kids, what happened to you?

28:51.110 --> 28:51.980
Did you…

28:52.060 --> 28:53.280
Did you get into a fight?

28:53.960 --> 28:55.230
-No!
-No!

28:55.230 --> 28:55.950
Nothing happened.

28:55.970 --> 28:57.060
Don't deny it!

28:57.320 --> 28:59.100
Look at you.

29:00.030 --> 29:01.030
What happened?

29:01.230 --> 29:02.140
It was…

29:02.170 --> 29:04.580
It was self-defense.

29:04.610 --> 29:05.920
Shao Xingchi!

29:07.660 --> 29:08.590
Come home with me!

29:11.510 --> 29:13.170
Wanghe, let's go.

29:13.810 --> 29:15.050
Mom, wait.

29:15.260 --> 29:15.720
Mom...

29:15.770 --> 29:16.860
Mom, it's not like that.

29:16.880 --> 29:18.200
Mom, listen…

29:18.400 --> 29:19.750
H-Hold on.

29:19.780 --> 29:20.980
What's wrong with you?

29:20.990 --> 29:22.220
Let me walk you home.

29:22.360 --> 29:23.100
Come in.

29:23.100 --> 29:24.630
Mom, I didn't start it!

29:24.630 --> 29:26.150
They started it.

29:26.280 --> 29:26.720
Mom.

29:26.750 --> 29:27.710
Can't you stay out of trouble

29:27.710 --> 29:28.910
for just one day?

29:28.950 --> 29:29.470
Let's go take a look.

29:29.470 --> 29:30.430
You taught me to be righteous!

29:30.470 --> 29:31.790
Righteous?

29:31.790 --> 29:32.620
Go ahead. Hit me!

29:32.740 --> 29:34.570
Hit me all you want.

29:34.590 --> 29:37.220
What? You feel aggrieved?

29:37.550 --> 29:38.150
You wanna hit me again?

29:38.190 --> 29:39.910
Go ahead!

29:41.730 --> 29:42.410
Fine.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.810
Fine. I won't hit you.

29:43.830 --> 29:44.550
Tell me

29:44.550 --> 29:45.310
what happened.

29:45.310 --> 29:46.070
Who did you fight with?

29:46.110 --> 29:48.510
Siyi was bullied

29:48.510 --> 29:49.990
by a bunch of punks at school.

29:49.990 --> 29:52.030
How could I just stand by?

29:57.750 --> 29:58.560
Sorry,

29:59.340 --> 30:00.370
I was wrong.

30:02.110 --> 30:03.190
Alright?

30:06.610 --> 30:07.910
But no matter what,

30:07.950 --> 30:08.740
in the future,

30:09.220 --> 30:10.570
don't fight again.

30:10.760 --> 30:11.510
Understand?

30:14.230 --> 30:15.280
Also,

30:16.180 --> 30:17.520
Siyi

30:17.950 --> 30:19.150
is sensitive.

30:19.410 --> 30:21.450
She's not as strong as you guys.

30:21.470 --> 30:23.990
Help her more.

30:24.020 --> 30:25.890
Treat her like your sister.

30:25.910 --> 30:26.900
Look out for her.

30:28.010 --> 30:28.940
Got it?

30:30.060 --> 30:30.740
Yes.

30:31.800 --> 30:32.650
Siyi,

30:32.920 --> 30:34.560
you're Wanghe's sister from now on.

30:38.860 --> 30:40.170
Are you hurt?

30:40.640 --> 30:41.470
No.

30:43.500 --> 30:44.420
Grandma,

30:44.800 --> 30:47.560
how long have our neighbors been living here?

30:51.320 --> 30:53.720
Very, very long.

30:56.180 --> 30:58.850
The Zhou family in the front yard

30:59.020 --> 31:01.600
moved here right after this place was built.

31:02.040 --> 31:04.620
I was there when Haikuo was born.

31:05.230 --> 31:07.200
He was such a sweet baby.

31:07.200 --> 31:09.110
He barely cried or threw tantrums.

31:09.150 --> 31:10.390
He was also smart.

31:10.530 --> 31:11.820
Before all his baby teeth came in,

31:11.840 --> 31:13.630
he could already recite many poems.

31:14.440 --> 31:16.470
♫When the moon shines in the sky♫

31:14.750 --> 31:15.720
Grandpa Zhou

31:15.750 --> 31:17.350
is an educated man.

31:17.080 --> 31:18.920
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

31:17.510 --> 31:19.670
The children raised by educated people

31:19.380 --> 31:22.850
♫Who is still by your side?♫

31:19.670 --> 31:21.030
are different.

31:23.840 --> 31:27.450
♫As time passes♫

31:24.030 --> 31:25.990
The Shao family next door…

31:28.230 --> 31:29.750
It's been eight years, I think.

31:28.260 --> 31:31.710
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

31:30.300 --> 31:33.430
When they came, Xingchi was only two and a half years old.

31:33.770 --> 31:36.050
He was always hungry.

31:35.670 --> 31:37.310
♫When youthful company fades♫

31:36.070 --> 31:37.590
He cried when he was hungry,

31:37.620 --> 31:39.700
and it was impossible to shush him.

31:37.870 --> 31:39.790
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

31:40.490 --> 31:43.960
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

31:40.900 --> 31:42.320
What about Wanghe?

31:42.340 --> 31:43.110
His family

31:43.150 --> 31:45.470
moved here with Fenghua's family.

31:45.290 --> 31:48.790
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

31:45.800 --> 31:47.600
They're all kind

31:47.880 --> 31:49.290
and very righteous.

31:49.600 --> 31:53.720
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

31:50.560 --> 31:51.590
Back then,

31:52.180 --> 31:54.100
when your dad was sick,

31:54.930 --> 31:57.870
I went to the provincial capital for treatment with him.

31:58.440 --> 32:01.660
♫Life is long♫

31:59.860 --> 32:02.490
I didn't know anyone there.

32:02.700 --> 32:06.550
Your Uncle Xie helped us a lot

32:02.940 --> 32:05.960
♫No need to dwell♫

32:06.550 --> 32:09.430
and was always there for us.

32:07.110 --> 32:10.480
♫Like moonlight♫

32:09.430 --> 32:11.540
He lost over 10 kilograms.

32:11.830 --> 32:15.190
♫Don't forget♫

32:14.200 --> 32:16.150
They're all good people.

32:17.260 --> 32:20.190
♫Life is long♫

32:17.940 --> 32:20.580
My mom's neighbors were like strangers.

32:20.600 --> 32:22.190
They didn't even say hi when they met.

32:21.310 --> 32:24.740
♫No need to dwell♫

32:25.190 --> 32:27.470
As the old saying goes,

32:25.880 --> 32:29.090
♫Like moonlight♫

32:27.470 --> 32:29.470
good neighbors are more helpful than distant relatives.

32:29.720 --> 32:33.250
But it's rare for neighbors to see each other as family.

32:30.500 --> 32:35.220
♫The old times♫

32:34.830 --> 32:36.550
You should cherish them.

32:37.480 --> 32:38.520
I will.

32:40.140 --> 32:41.860
Good girl.

32:41.870 --> 32:43.960
All right. Do your homework.

32:55.460 --> 32:57.230
♫When the moon shines in the sky♫

32:58.120 --> 32:59.650
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

33:00.300 --> 33:03.750
♫Who is still by your side?♫

33:05.030 --> 33:08.450
♫As time passes♫

33:09.340 --> 33:12.810
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

33:23.580 --> 33:25.320
Mr. Zhou, let me tell you.

33:26.100 --> 33:27.830
The new ship

33:27.830 --> 33:29.490
is a good bargain.

33:29.520 --> 33:30.870
You know why? Because

33:30.870 --> 33:33.430
the main engine of this ship

33:34.060 --> 33:35.350
is imported.

33:35.740 --> 33:37.510
A foreign engine.

33:37.510 --> 33:39.270
It's fuel-efficient

33:39.270 --> 33:40.680
and makes less noise.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.410
Hey.

33:41.870 --> 33:42.630
Have a seat.

33:42.630 --> 33:43.230
Hello.

33:43.230 --> 33:43.670
Hello.

33:43.670 --> 33:44.660
We're talking about the engine,

33:44.660 --> 33:45.630
the latest model.

33:46.980 --> 33:48.690
We've found a buyer

33:48.720 --> 33:50.230
for our old ship.

33:50.550 --> 33:51.910
He offered a fair price.

33:51.910 --> 33:53.020
Right, Lao'er?

33:53.220 --> 33:54.150
As for the new ship,

33:54.150 --> 33:56.060
we've contacted

33:56.060 --> 33:57.440
the shipyard.

33:57.910 --> 33:59.430
As long as the payment is made,

33:59.430 --> 34:01.390
we can get the ship in one week.

34:01.590 --> 34:02.590
So fast.

34:02.910 --> 34:03.830
So, I've explained

34:03.830 --> 34:05.190
everything to you.

34:05.190 --> 34:06.870
If you think it's feasible,

34:06.890 --> 34:08.040
chip in.

34:08.080 --> 34:09.580
If you're not interested,

34:09.620 --> 34:10.949
drop out.

34:11.020 --> 34:12.980
We'll still be friends either way.

34:12.980 --> 34:14.300
Don't feel pressured.

34:14.350 --> 34:15.590
No pressure.

34:15.590 --> 34:16.389
I told you.

34:16.389 --> 34:17.870
We'll chip in, right?

34:17.909 --> 34:19.350
Dad, I've brought the money.

34:19.350 --> 34:20.870
Cut me in.

34:21.389 --> 34:22.580
No, no, no.

34:22.630 --> 34:23.389
Granny Ma.

34:23.520 --> 34:24.159
Don't do this.

34:24.179 --> 34:25.969
You don't have much money,

34:26.070 --> 34:28.179
and now you have a granddaughter to raise.

34:28.219 --> 34:29.540
You don't have to invest,

34:29.560 --> 34:31.800
but you can keep your shares.

34:31.840 --> 34:32.610
Exactly.

34:32.830 --> 34:33.750
No way.

34:33.750 --> 34:35.469
I'd feel terrible.

34:35.469 --> 34:36.550
No, no!

34:36.590 --> 34:38.000
What's wrong with you?

34:38.469 --> 34:39.790
Tiancheng, listen.

34:39.830 --> 34:41.190
Don't feel pressured.

34:41.429 --> 34:42.510
We all made money

34:42.550 --> 34:44.659
from your ship in the past.

34:45.310 --> 34:46.389
Whether this is profitable or not,

34:46.389 --> 34:47.360
with the canal still operating,

34:47.670 --> 34:50.150
I don't believe you, Boss Xie,

34:50.150 --> 34:51.550
can't make ends meet.

34:52.389 --> 34:53.110
Yeah!

34:53.139 --> 34:53.960
Yeah!

34:53.960 --> 34:54.310
Okay.

34:54.350 --> 34:55.880
We'll keep your money.

34:56.190 --> 34:57.510
No need to ask us.

34:57.550 --> 34:58.830
We all listen to you.

34:58.830 --> 35:00.150
This is our money.

35:00.150 --> 35:01.590
We're also in.

35:01.630 --> 35:02.150
Look.

35:02.150 --> 35:02.820
Yes.

35:02.910 --> 35:03.990
Here's the money.

35:05.180 --> 35:06.740
Is the money enough?

35:06.950 --> 35:09.230
I think it's almost enough.

35:09.270 --> 35:11.070
Later, Lao'er and I

35:11.670 --> 35:12.750
will count…

35:12.750 --> 35:13.320
Count the money.

35:13.350 --> 35:14.830
Count the money, and then decide

35:14.830 --> 35:16.980
how many shares you get based on the amount of your money.

35:16.980 --> 35:18.670
We'll do it the old way.

35:18.670 --> 35:18.990
Okay.

35:18.990 --> 35:19.480
Are we clear?

35:19.480 --> 35:19.990
Yeah.

35:19.990 --> 35:21.790
Don't worry. After we make the payment,

35:21.830 --> 35:22.950
we can see

35:22.950 --> 35:24.070
our new ship

35:24.110 --> 35:25.910
in one week!

35:46.670 --> 35:47.630
Let me have a look.

35:47.670 --> 35:49.030
I'm not done yet.

35:49.030 --> 35:50.150
Let me take a look.

35:50.150 --> 35:51.030
Give it to her.

35:51.030 --> 35:51.950
You bad boy.

35:57.550 --> 35:58.580
Can I have a try?

35:58.760 --> 35:59.860
You want to have a try?

35:59.980 --> 36:00.780
Okay.

36:03.550 --> 36:05.710
Son, after a few years,

36:05.710 --> 36:07.360
when the Grand Canal is dredged,

36:07.430 --> 36:08.950
we'll sail this ship

36:08.950 --> 36:11.060
all the way north to Beijing!

36:11.060 --> 36:11.630
I want to go too!

36:11.630 --> 36:12.580
No problem.

36:12.670 --> 36:13.150
Alright.

36:13.150 --> 36:13.790
Let me take over.

36:17.110 --> 36:18.030
Dad.

36:18.030 --> 36:19.550
I've never seen the sea.

36:19.550 --> 36:20.950
When can we sail this ship

36:20.950 --> 36:22.080
to the sea?

36:22.080 --> 36:23.500
Sail this ship to the sea?

36:23.500 --> 36:23.960
Yes.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.700
It may look big,

36:25.700 --> 36:26.580
but on the sea,

36:26.630 --> 36:28.270
it's just a small ship.

36:28.270 --> 36:30.150
To withstand the winds and waves on the sea,

36:30.150 --> 36:32.570
we need a much bigger ship.

36:32.710 --> 36:34.550
You know what a 10,000-ton ship is like?

36:34.630 --> 36:35.430
After I grow up,

36:35.430 --> 36:36.550
I'll buy you a 10,000-ton ship,

36:36.630 --> 36:38.070
and we'll sail it to the sea.

36:39.670 --> 36:41.210
Good boy. You've got ambition!

36:41.270 --> 36:42.790
I'll wait for that day.

36:44.320 --> 36:45.460
You've got ambition.

36:45.940 --> 36:47.200
A 10,000-ton ship.

37:06.400 --> 37:09.030
Grandma, I'm taking Siyi for a swim.

37:09.100 --> 37:10.280
Grandma, can I go with them

37:10.280 --> 37:11.110
for a swim?

37:11.110 --> 37:11.910
Be careful.

37:11.910 --> 37:12.450
Okay.

37:12.490 --> 37:13.010
Okay.

37:13.230 --> 37:14.190
Wanghe.

37:14.190 --> 37:14.630
We're leaving!

37:14.630 --> 37:15.510
Take care of your friends!

37:15.510 --> 37:17.030
Fenghua, keep an eye on Siyi.

37:17.030 --> 37:18.790
Don't swim too far into the deep water.

37:20.290 --> 37:22.430
Fenghua, you're as slow as a turtle!

37:22.730 --> 37:23.570
Hurry up!

37:31.180 --> 37:33.140
I want to be a captain in the future.

37:33.170 --> 37:34.180
I'll buy a big ship

37:34.390 --> 37:35.230
and sail all the way south.

37:35.270 --> 37:37.100
I'll go to Sanjiangkou, then out to the open sea,

37:37.180 --> 37:39.000
and onward to the Suez Canal.

37:39.330 --> 37:40.280
I'll go with you.

37:40.780 --> 37:41.670
No women on board.

37:41.690 --> 37:43.670
I'll buy a ship myself and be a female captain.

37:46.590 --> 37:48.190
Can you even swim?

37:48.210 --> 37:49.730
I swim better than you.

37:49.770 --> 37:50.690
Stop bragging.

37:52.230 --> 37:53.880
Let's find it out in the water.

37:54.220 --> 37:55.180
No problem.

37:56.070 --> 37:57.740
The one who gets there first wins.

37:57.830 --> 37:58.710
Okay.

37:58.730 --> 37:59.800
-Come on.
-Come on.

38:08.070 --> 38:09.080
Ready?

38:11.450 --> 38:13.560
One, two, three, jump!

38:31.550 --> 38:32.350
Slow down!

39:55.780 --> 39:58.020
[2007]

40:11.390 --> 40:12.120
Fenghua!

40:12.170 --> 40:13.140
Jump in!

40:13.430 --> 40:14.310
Jump in!

40:14.310 --> 40:15.000
Jump in!

40:15.000 --> 40:16.190
Jump in!

40:16.190 --> 40:18.350
I told you my mom washed my swimsuit.

40:18.350 --> 40:19.440
So what?

40:19.470 --> 40:20.070
Just jump in.

40:20.070 --> 40:20.780
Jump in!

40:20.800 --> 40:21.600
Jump in!

40:21.600 --> 40:22.230
Jump in!

40:22.230 --> 40:23.870
Siyi, how can you side with them?

40:23.870 --> 40:25.710
Jump in. Come on!

40:25.790 --> 40:26.390
Come on.

40:26.420 --> 40:27.190
Jump in!

40:27.190 --> 40:28.270
-Jump in!
-Come on!

40:28.270 --> 40:29.150
I'm warning you.

40:29.150 --> 40:29.830
Stop splashing,

40:29.830 --> 40:31.470
or you'll have to go home naked.

40:32.070 --> 40:32.960
Jump in!

40:33.070 --> 40:33.950
Jump in!

40:33.950 --> 40:35.260
Don't make me come up there and push you.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.550
Are you too scared to jump?

40:36.550 --> 40:38.010
Why would I be scared?

40:38.330 --> 40:39.690
You think I'm scared?

40:42.430 --> 40:43.510
Don't take away our clothes!

40:43.510 --> 40:44.870
Leave something for me!

40:44.870 --> 40:46.610
There's nothing I don't dare do.

40:47.350 --> 40:49.190
Go home naked!

40:49.370 --> 40:49.830
Fenghua!

40:49.910 --> 40:50.390
Fenghua!

40:50.390 --> 40:51.560
Xia Fenghua!

40:54.120 --> 40:55.120
-Fenghua!
-Fenghua!

40:55.160 --> 40:55.630
Help!

40:55.710 --> 40:57.050
That's what you get for messing with me.

40:57.640 --> 40:58.860
Help!

40:58.900 --> 41:00.550
Someone fell into the river!

41:00.570 --> 41:01.160
Let's go.

41:02.620 --> 41:04.310
You can't die!

41:04.330 --> 41:06.840
We're in so much debt!

41:07.070 --> 41:09.910
How are our kid and I going to live?

41:09.940 --> 41:11.410
Watch your step!

41:32.630 --> 41:33.630
What happened?

41:33.670 --> 41:34.550
Mom.

41:35.670 --> 41:36.840
What's going on?

41:37.450 --> 41:38.790
Wu, the seafarer,

41:40.350 --> 41:41.720
couldn't pay his debt

41:41.740 --> 41:43.090
and took his own life.

41:43.130 --> 41:44.830
Didn't he just buy a new ship?

41:44.900 --> 41:46.300
How is he in debt?

41:46.630 --> 41:47.310
He gambled?

41:47.310 --> 41:49.490
He borrowed money to buy the ship, but it was hard to get orders.

41:49.520 --> 41:51.310
He shipped coal last month

41:51.340 --> 41:52.380
and counted on it to pay his debt.

41:52.400 --> 41:53.560
But he overloaded the ship

41:53.600 --> 41:55.150
and was fined a lot of money.

41:55.720 --> 41:57.410
There are more and more highways

41:57.440 --> 41:59.170
and fewer and fewer ships.

41:59.390 --> 42:00.490
What should we do?

42:00.720 --> 42:02.170
The tide of change

42:02.590 --> 42:04.720
is unstoppable

42:04.750 --> 42:08.180
and leaves its mark on everyone.

42:08.230 --> 42:09.760
Seven years ago,

42:09.780 --> 42:12.340
the Beijing-Shanghai Expressway, which spans the Yellow River

42:12.370 --> 42:15.820
and leaps over the Yangtze River, was put into operation.

42:15.960 --> 42:18.500
Since then, it has greatly promoted

42:18.530 --> 42:22.130
the development of areas along the route and even the national economy.

42:22.810 --> 42:26.450
The cars on shore are running faster and faster.

42:26.620 --> 42:29.090
The seafarers who make a living on the water

42:29.130 --> 42:31.760
find it harder and harder

42:31.780 --> 42:34.190
to feel a sense of honor and accomplishment.

42:34.700 --> 42:37.870
Business is getting smaller and smaller.

42:37.900 --> 42:40.540
Profits are dwindling.

42:41.350 --> 42:42.820
The shipping business on the canal

42:42.850 --> 42:45.270
seems to be moving forward

42:45.310 --> 42:48.100
with this fast-paced world,

42:48.220 --> 42:51.080
but actually, it's going in the opposite direction.

42:51.500 --> 42:53.300
However, the spirit of the canal

42:53.330 --> 42:57.360
is already flowing in the blood of the canal people.

42:57.750 --> 42:59.730
The new era has presented new challenges

42:59.750 --> 43:01.740
for the young generation

43:01.770 --> 43:03.700
living by the canal.
